nt-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/40 hover:text-white py-2 transition-colors\">Office<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm transition-transform duration-500 \">expand_more</span></button></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-4 lg:gap-8\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white/40 hover:text-white font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] no-underline transition-all group\" href=\"/sign-in\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-lg opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all\">person</span>Login</a><a class=\"relative px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-white no-underline transition-all overflow-hidden group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/sign-up\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-primary group-hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-white/20 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"></div><span class=\"relative z-10\">Join</span><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sm relative z-10 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></div><button class=\"lg:hidden w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white transition-all hover:bg-white/10\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-xl\">menu</span></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto min-h-screen relative overflow-visible pb-24\"><div class=\"fixed top-0 right-0 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[160px] -z-10\"></div><div class=\"fixed -bottom-48 -left-48 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-secondary/5 rounded-full blur-[140px] -z-10\"></div><header class=\"p-8 md:p-12 lg:py-32 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-8 border-b border-white/10 mb-24\"><span class=\"inline-block px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary/5 text-primary text-[10px] font-black tracking-[0.4em] uppercase border border-primary/10\">The District Authority</span><h1 class=\"text-6xl md:text-9xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter font-display uppercase leading-none italic\">Architecting <br/><span class=\"text-primary not-italic\">Social Change.</span></h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-3xl text-text-muted max-w-3xl font-medium leading-tight opacity-70 italic\">Rotaract District 3192 is a thriving network of young leaders committed to institutional excellence and sustainable community impact.</p></header><section class=\"px-8 md:px-12 py-12 space-y-24\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\"><div class=\"group relative bg-navy/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[4rem] p-12 border border-white/5 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:shadow-primary/5 flex flex-col gap-8 \"><div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-white/5 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-navy transition-all duration-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl\">rocket_launch</span></div><div class=\"space-y-5\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-white leading-none font-display tracking-tighter uppercase italic group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Our Mission</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-white/50 font-medium leading-relaxed font-serif italic\">To provide opportunities for young men and women to enhance their knowledge and skills that will assist them in personal development, to address the physical and social needs of their communities.</p></div><div class=\"pt-8 border-t border-white/10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[10px]\">Status: Authorized<span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative bg-navy/40 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[4rem] p-12 border border-white/5 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 hover:shadow-primary/5 flex flex-col gap-8 lg:translate-y-16\"><div class=\"w-20 h-20 bg-white/5 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-navy transition-all duration-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-5xl\">visibility</span></div><div class=\"space-y-5\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl font-black text-white leading-none font-display tracking-tighter uppercase italic group-hover:text-primary transition-colors\">Our Vision</h3><p class=\"text-lg text-white/50 font-medium leading-relaxed font-serif italic\">Together, we see a world where young people unite and take action to create lasting change — across the globe, in our communities, and in ourselves.</p></div><div class=\"pt-8 border-t border-white/10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[10px]\">Status: Authorized<span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse\"></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-[4rem] overflow-hidden aspect-video relative group border border-white/10 shadow-ambient\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#020617] via-transparent to-transparent z-10 opacity-80\"></div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559027615-cd4451d13488?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200\" alt=\"Service\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-1000\"/><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-12 lg:p-20 z-20 w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl space-y-4\"><h3 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white font-display tracking-tighter uppercase italic\">Service Above <span class=\"text-primary\">Self.</span></h3><p class=\"text-xl text-text-muted font-medium leading-tight opacity-80 italic\">Through every project and every handshake, we aim to build a legacy of excellence that transcends generations.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-8 md:px-12 py-32 space-y-24\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 text-center items-center\"><span class=\"text-primary font-black tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-[10px] px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10\">The Foundations</span><h2 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tighter font-display uppercase leading-none italic\">Core <span class=\"text-primary not-italic\">Pillars.</span></h2><p class=\"text-text-muted text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase italic\">The Four Avenues of Service</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\"><div class=\"group p-10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-500 space-y-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">groups</span></div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-white font-display uppercase tracking-tight italic\">Club Service</h3><p class=\"text-text-muted font-medium leading-relaxed italic opacity-80\">Focusing on strengthening fellowship and ensuring the effective functioning of the club.</p></div><div class=\"group p-10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-500 space-y-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">work</span></div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-white font-display uppercase tracking-tight italic\">Vocational Service</h3><p class=\"text-text-muted font-medium leading-relaxed italic opacity-80\">Encouraging high ethical standards in business and professions and recognizing the worth of all useful occupations.</p></div><div class=\"group p-10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-500 space-y-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">volunteer_activism</span></div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-white font-display uppercase tracking-tight italic\">Community Service</h3><p class=\"text-text-muted font-medium leading-relaxed italic opacity-80\">Developing and implementing projects that improve the quality of life in our local communities.</p></div><div class=\"group p-10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-500 space-y-6\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-3xl\">public</span></div><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-white font-display uppercase tracking-tight italic\">International Service</h3><p class=\"text-text-muted font-medium leading-relaxed italic opacity-80\">Expanding our reach globally to foster understanding, goodwill, and peace between nations.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"px-8 md:px-12 py-32\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 text-center items-center mb-24\"><span class=\"text-primary font-black tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-[10px] px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10\">District Core Team</span><h2 class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tighter font-display uppercase leading-none italic\">Strategic <span class=\"text-primary not-italic\">Leadership.</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 shadow-ambient hover:bg-white/10 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-white/10\"><img src=\"https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Priya+Ramesh&amp;background=0e6ba8&amp;color=caf0f8&amp;size=400\" alt=\"Dr. Priya Ramesh\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-1000\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white font-display tracking-tighter uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-none italic\">Dr. Priya Ramesh</h3><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60\">District Rotaract Representative</p></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 shadow-ambient hover:bg-white/10 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-white/10\"><img src=\"https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Rahul+Krishnan&amp;background=00b4d8&amp;color=020b18&amp;size=400\" alt=\"Rahul Krishnan\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-1000\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white font-display tracking-tighter uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-none italic\">Rahul Krishnan</h3><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60\">District Secretary</p></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 shadow-ambient hover:bg-white/10 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-white/10\"><img src=\"https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Sneha+Venkatesh&amp;background=0e6ba8&amp;color=caf0f8&amp;size=400\" alt=\"Sneha Venkatesh\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-1000\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white font-display tracking-tighter uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-none italic\">Sneha Venkatesh</h3><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60\">District Treasurer</p></div></div><div class=\"group bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl p-8 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/10 shadow-ambient hover:bg-white/10 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-700 flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"aspect-square rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-white/10\"><img src=\"https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Karthik+Reddy&amp;background=00b4d8&amp;color=020b18&amp;size=400\" alt=\"Karthik Reddy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-1000\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white font-display tracking-tighter uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors leading-none italic\">Karthik Reddy</h3><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-60\">Professional Service Chair</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-8 md:px-12 py-32 bg-white/5 rounded-[4rem] border border-white/10 mx-8 md:mx-12\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-24\"><div class=\"text-center space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter font-display uppercase leading-none italic\">The Legacy <span class=\"text-primary not-italic\">of 3192.</span></h2><div class=\"h-1 w-24 bg-primary mx-auto rounded-full\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-12 text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-muted font-medium leading-relaxed italic opacity-80\"><p>Rotaract originally began as a Rotary International youth program in 1968. Today, Rotaract operates globally with over 10,000 clubs in 180 countries.</p><p>District 3192 has a rich legacy of vibrant youth action in South India. Formed to concentrate impact within key urban and rural demographics, 3192 acts as a catalyst for professional development and massive community service projects.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-[3.5rem] p-12 lg:p-20 border border-white/10 shadow-ambient relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[80px] -z-10 group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-1000\"></div><div class=\"text-center space-y-10 relative z-10\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-primary font-display uppercase tracking-tight italic\">&quot;Friendship through Service&quot;</h3><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium leading-tight opacity-70 italic\">Join a global movement of young leaders making an impact. Start your journey with Rotaract District 3192 today.</p><a href=\"/clubs\" class=\"inline-flex bg-primary text-white px-12 py-6 rounded-[2rem] font-black text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] shadow-xl shadow-primary/20 hover:shadow-primary/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all group/btn relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/10 translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-1000\"></div><span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-4\">Find local club<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-lg group-hover/btn:translate-x-2 transition-transform\">bolt</span></span></a></div></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class=\"bg-transparent border-t border-white/5 py-40 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[140px] -z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-24 pb-24 border-b bord